$" 13194139533386 17592186045585 true] [17592186105495 1071 "Let $\\mathbf{a}=\\langle 3,3,-1 \\rangle$ and $\\mathbf{b}=\\langle 2,-7,0 \\rangle$. Find the scalar projection of $\\mathbf{a}$ onto $\\mathbf{b}$." 13194139533386 17592186045585 false] [17592186105495 1071 "Let $\\mathbf{a}=\\langle 3,3,-1 \\rangle$ and $\\mathbf{b}=\\langle 2,-7,0 \\rangle.$ Find the scalar projection of $\\mathbf{a}$ onto $\\mathbf{b}.$" 13194139533386 17592186045585 true] [17592186105495 1074 "Using the formula for the scalar projection, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ncomp_{b}a &= \\frac{a \\cdot b}{\\mid b \\mid} \\\\\n&= \\frac{a_{x}b_{x} + a_{y}b_{y} + a_{z}b_{z}}{\\sqrt{b_{x}^{2} + b_{y}^{2} + b_{z}^{2}}} \\\\\n&= (3 \\cdot 2 + 3 \\cdot (-7) + (-1) \\cdot 0)/(\\sqrt{2^{2} + (-7)^{2} + 0^{2}}) \\\\\n&=-\\frac{15}{\\sqrt{53}}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533386 17592186045585 false] [17592186105495 1074 "Using the formula for the scalar projection, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{b}\\,a & =\\frac{a\\cdot b}{|\\,b\\,|} \\\\  & =\\frac{{a}_{x}{b}_{x}+{a}_{y}{b}_{y}+{a}_{z}{b}_{z}}{\\sqrt{{b}_{x}^{2}+{b}_{y}^{2}+{b}_{z}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{3\\cdot 2+3\\cdot (-7)+(-1)\\cdot 0}{\\sqrt{{2}^{2}+(-7)^{2}+{0}^{2}}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{15}{\\sqrt{53}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533386 17592186045585 true] [17592186105496 1071 "Let ![](images/e4/e477b14c9148f4132c747a358e1e99f76d40df85b82c66d6e7dd38581b33913c.png) and ![](images/b1/b17d86e3e395b2fd752f5529090c0a5e4e2fdce17642be5594bee98e8c47fed2.png) Find the scalar projection of $\\mathbf{a}$ onto $\\mathbf{b}.$" 13194139533386 17592186045585 true] [17592186105496 1071 "Let $\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}$ and $\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}$ Find the scalar projection of $\\mathbf{a}$ onto $\\mathbf{b}$." 13194139533386 17592186045585 false] [17592186105496 1074 "Using the formula for the scalar projection, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ncomp_{b}a &= \\frac{a \\cdot b}{\\mid b \\mid} 